Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui/web): mobile header window-controls padding, persisted
 scroll memory, soft reconnect, restore convergence

- WorkspaceHeader: window-control padding only on desktop; web drawer
  viewport uses pl-20 for overlay buttons; mobile title max-w 46vw
- chatSessionScrollMemory: sessionStorage mirror (LRU 40) + degenerate
  snapshot guard (pinned=false at bottom not persisted)
- ConversationTimeline: restore anchors by distance-from-bottom;
  convergence effect re-anchors to saved distance within 4s budget;
  user scroll intent cancels restore; single-owner arming in restore
- web main.tsx: soft reconnect with exponential backoff (1/2/4/8s),
  React re-mount via connectionEpoch key, reload only as last resort
- useProviderSettingsView: drop redundant getServerSnapshot arg
- spec: packages/ui/specs/web-recovery.md
